"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-28T23:53:40Z","updated_at":"2026-02-28T23:54:01Z","body":"This is the behavior as of 4.7.dev 1aaea38e7:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f347cea1-4240-409c-bdf6-507b90857316\n\nThe blend shape scene has much less aggressive LOD (it barely happens unless you are extremely far). This is intended, as meshoptimizer is aware of blend shapes and will use more conservative LOD to avoid visible degradations once the mesh is deformed by blend shapes.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ad083afb-c51e-4517-b4b7-8299d840dd3a\n\nThe current behavior seems to be good, but regardless, I've opened https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116908 to make this clearer.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3978655422/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]